@startuml CU-28
actor "Admin / Encargado" as Adm
boundary "«UI» Angular (Admin/Inventario)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /inventory/movements" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» InventoryService / InventoryMovement" as Model
database "«DB» PostgreSQL (Neon)" as DB

Adm -> UI : 1: Accede a "Movimientos de Inventario"
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /api/v1/inventory/movements?branch_id=1
Ctrl -> Model : 3: list_movements(db, branch_id, variant_id)
Model -> DB : 4: SELECT InventoryMovement ORDER BY created_at DESC
Model --> Ctrl : 5: list[InventoryMovementRead] {type, qty_change, reason, created_at, user}
Ctrl --> UI : 6: list[InventoryMovementRead]
UI --> Adm : 7: Lista movimientos (entrada, salida, ajuste, transferencia, merma, devolución)

note right of Adm : Tipos:\n- PURCHASE, SALE, RESERVATION\n- ADJUSTMENT\n- TRANSFER_IN/OUT\n- RETURN, SHRINKAGE

Adm -> UI : 1: Registra movimiento manual
UI -> Ctrl : 2: POST /inventory/movements {branch_id, variant_id, type, qty_change, reason}
Ctrl -> Model : 3: create_movement(db, branch_id, variant_id, type, qty_change, reason)
Model -> Model : 4: Valida tipo y cantidad
Model -> DB : 5: INSERT InventoryMovement
Model -> DB : 6: UPDATE Inventory (quantity += qty_change)
Model --> Ctrl : 7: InventoryMovementRead creado
Ctrl --> UI : 8: InventoryMovementRead
UI --> Adm : 9: Movimiento registrado + stock actualizado

Adm -> UI : 1: Filtra por tipo/fecha
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /inventory/movements?type=ADJUSTMENT&start_date=...&end_date=...
Ctrl -> Model : 3: list_movements(db, branch_id, variant_id, type, start_date, end_date)
Model -> DB : 4: SELECT con filtros
Model --> Ctrl : 5: list[InventoryMovementRead] filtrado
Ctrl --> UI : 6: list filtrado
UI --> Adm : 7: Movimientos filtrados

@enduml